window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>The rules of Society X are simple...break them and you're out. </p> <p>Rule #1 - No names </p> <p>It doesn't matter if you want to know, it's forbidden. </p> <p>Rule #2 - No exchanging numbers </p> <p>It doesn't matter if you want to call, it's forbidden. </p> <p>Rule #3 - Everything is to remain strictly anonymous. </p> <p>It doesn't matter if you want to tell, it's forbidden. </p> <p>Whatever your desire. Whatever your fetish. The Play Room is the place to go. </p> <p>For Alexandria Miller, it's a chance to express herself, to embrace her hidden passions. </p> <p>For Kai Robicheau, being in the club brings out who he truly is. </p> <p>What happens in the Play Room will have you aching for more.... </p>"; 
